# Manual example requests for trying out the API locally.
# Start the service with "dotnet run --project src/CompanyEnrichment.Api",
# and click "Send Request" above a request (REST Client in VS Code or Visual Studio).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5162

### Lookup by CVR number (Novo Nordisk)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/24256790?year=2024

### Lookup by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies?name=Novo Nordisk A/S&year=2024

### New industry code (DB25) without statistics at DST -> industryStatistics: null
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/35954716?year=2024

### Year without data at DST -> industryStatistics: null
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/24256790?year=2030

### Company does not exist -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/12345678?year=2024

### Missing year -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/24256790

### Metrics in Prometheus format (response time and status codes for the service and the external sources)
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics
